{"id":"steam-1054190","steam":1054190,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Parkour Bot","summary":"Parkour Bot is a fast paced, rhythm based, physics platform game, with an unique movement set of main character. Show your skills and get a lot of achievements in 100 dynamic levels.","about":"Zdravím všechny hráče, kteří sem zavítali během „CZ & SK Games Week 2024“. Vyzkoušet si zde můžete demo hry. Demo má zatím hotovou hlavní mechaniku, tj. fyziku hlavní postavy. Na grafice, zvucích, úrovních atd. budu pracovat. Plná hra by měla mít i achievementy a žebříčky. Budu rád za každý wishlist a hlavně odezvu v komunitním centru. Super bude, když zasídlíte video nebo screenshot z vašeho hraní.  Pokud narazíte na chybu napište zde do diskuze. \n\nDěkuju.\n\nParkour bot - 5 best game features\n\n1) Unique playable character = Unique game experience\r\n\n2) Physics based levels = Lots of unexpected events & more fun\r\n\n3) Diverse enemies = New challenges\r\n\n4) Less talking = More playing\r\n\n5) A lot of achievements = Speedrunners are welcome\r\n\n\r\n\nFast paced rhythm based physics platform game, with an unique movement set of main character and dynamic levels. No story, just your skill. So what are you waiting for?","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054190/library_600x900.jpg?t=1792960298","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054190/header.jpg?t=1792960298","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054190/library_hero.jpg?t=1792960298","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054190/header.jpg?t=1792960298","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054190/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1792960298","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054190/ss_e8c61200cf6ba426b023bc276421443263b48187.600x338.jpg?t=1792960298","full":"